    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="003" status="pending">T0 pass and the T13 route-mechanism decision in notes/phase0-results.md</dependency>
      <dependency task="017" status="pending">DecisionToolError type consumed by McpToolResults (017 completes in an earlier wave)</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">MCP registers only through AddMcpModule (Infrastructure/DI/McpModule.cs) and maps only through MapMcpEndpoints called from EndpointMappingExtensions.cs; v1 maps exactly /mcp/legal-operations.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-032">When Mcp:Enabled is false (the default), /mcp/legal-operations is still mapped and answers 503 ProblemDetails from a null object; no tool handler runs; registration is symmetric (no conditional DI that breaks startup).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-016">The mcp rate-limit policy is a new named policy in RateLimitingModule.cs partitioned per caller (oid), shaped like the existing per-user partition at L301-322; the chosen limits are recorded in notes/decisions.md.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-001">The endpoint is stateless (no session store, no affinity), sets a request-body limit of 256 KiB on /mcp/*, disables response buffering for streamed responses, and adds no Functions or Durable packages.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">/mcp/legal-operations calls .RequireAuthorization() on the default workforce scheme; A10 refusals, protected-resource metadata and per-tool policies are task 021's.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Tool types are discovered per area by attribute (one class per tool under Api/Mcp/{Area}/{Group}/), so tool tasks 022–024 add files without editing a shared registration file; no tools/list exact-set assertion is added here (025 owns it).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Microsoft.Extensions.AI moves 10.3.0 → 10.11.x only with the AI unit and integration suites passing before merge (NFR-08); every pinned dependency comment in the csproj (L34-L133) is updated to match.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-052">This task adds no BackgroundService, timer or queued work; every operation it adds completes inside the request (every MCP tool under 30 s).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015">Every log statement or telemetry property this task adds records identifiers, sizes, timings and outcome/reason codes only: no bearer token, claim value, record text or tool argument (NFR-05).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source text: spec.md 'Placement Justification'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': a delta of +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, a total of 55 MB or more triggers architecture review, and the total must stay at or under 60 MB (hard stop). No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**), mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Any defect found and not fixed in this task is filed with /project-defer-issue-tracking (notes/defer-issues.md AND a GitHub issue), never one without the other (project CLAUDE.md §2).</constraint>
  </constraints>

